Z||000004||cobra427||01-02-2000||10:36 PM||||I got your # this morning thanks. I will e-mail mine a little latter.  The connection that they are speaking of is the connector that goes to each injector. Just make sure that it is attached properly. You'll see them coming off the fuel rail. Unfortunately you can't see them all, but you are only concerned with #1 cyl. Just make sure that it is connected properly. You may even want to switch plugs to see if the problem moves to the other cylinder. Also check to see if the firering order on the cap is right. Who knows......||||reg||1
